    "created_at": "2016-12-15T20:29:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-12-15T20:29:04Z",
    "body": "Blink appears to be following the current spec here: https://jsbin.com/nocamakiqi/edit?html,output\r\n\r\nI think the idea is that if you remove open yourself, you'd better know what you're doing, as it hides the dialog but does not unblock the document. That's what this note tries to emphasize.",
