    "created_at": "2016-12-15T21:12:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-12-15T21:12:53Z",
    "body": "The note also kind of suggests that removing `open` is a good way to hide the dialog. But I would rather recommend using the `hidden` attribute to only hide it.",
