    "created_at": "2016-12-15T21:13:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-12-15T21:13:35Z",
    "body": "Yeah, I agree it's not great. Like with #2185, I think it's a question of whether Gecko wants to depart from Blink here in favor of something that's better, and then we'll have two divergent implementations. (Maybe that'll be an effective way of getting authors to not remove the `open` attribute!) But unlike #2185, I'm not sure it's that much of a win to make removing the `open` attribute work well; I'd rather just say, don't do that.",
